id: 33
hanzi: 反应
pinyin: fǎn yìng
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Verb

meanings_summary:
  en: to react; to respond; reaction; chemical reaction; response; physiological reflex
  es: reaccionar; responder; reacción; reflejo; respuesta a un estímulo; reacción química

senses[2]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Verb | Standard | to exhibit a behavioral, physiological, or emotional response to an external stimulus or situation | mostrar una respuesta fisiológica, conductual o anímica ante un estímulo o hecho exterior | 做出灵敏反应 (make an agile reaction)
  2 | Noun | Standard | a change or response produced in a person, organism, or chemical compound by an outside agent | cambio, respuesta o fenómeno provocado por un agente externo en un organismo o sustancia | 毫无反应 (zero response)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 李广的长箭如流星般射入深草，然而草丛中却一片死寂，那只所谓的猛虎竟然连一点儿反应也没有。 | Lǐ Guǎng de chángjiàn rú liúxīng bān shèrù shēncǎo, rán'ér cǎocóng zhōng què yípiàn sǐjì, nà zhī suǒwèi de měnghǔ jìngrán lián yìdiǎnr fǎnyìng yě méiyǒu. | Li Guang's arrow shot like a meteor into the deep grass, yet deadly silence hung over the thicket; the tiger showed no reaction at all. | La flecha de Li Guang cruzó la maleza como un meteoro, pero un silencio sepulcral envolvió el matorral; el supuesto tigre no mostró la menor reacción.
  #2 | 面对突发公共卫生安全事件，应急指挥中心敏锐研判态势，在半小时内迅速启动了一级响应机制。 | Miànduì tūfā gōnggòng wèishēng ānquán shìjiàn, yīngjí zhǐhuī zhōngxīn mǐnruì yánpàn tàishì, zài bàn xiǎoshí nèi xùnsù qǐdòng le yījí xiǎngyìng jīzhì. | Facing a sudden public health crisis, the emergency center assessed the scenario and swiftly launched a level-one response within thirty minutes. | Ante una imprevista crisis de salud pública, el centro de emergencias evaluó la coyuntura e implementó con presteza un protocolo de respuesta de máximo nivel.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  做出反应 | make or give a reaction
  毫无反应 | show zero reaction; unresponsive
  反应敏捷 | have quick, agile reflexes
  不良反应 | adverse reaction (medication)
  连锁反应 | chain reaction
  化学反应 | chemical reaction

idioms[4]{hanzi,pinyin,meaning_en}:
  得心应手 | dé xīn yìng shǒu | hand responds smoothly to the heart's mind; proficient and effortless
  连锁反应 | lián suǒ fǎn yìng | chain reaction; ripple effect
  一呼百应 | yì hū bǎi yìng | one calls and a hundred respond; widespread rallying
  应接不暇 | yìng jiē bù xiá | overwhelmed with more calls and events than one can handle

character_decomposition[2]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  反 | fǎn | return; reverse; rebel; contrary | volver; invertir; oponerse; contrario | 又 | right hand | 厂 (cliff, obstacle / inversion) | 又 (yòu, right hand) | 4 | 半包围结构 | Ancient oracle bone pictogram of a hand 又 turning itself over beneath a cliff shelter 厂 to oppose or reverse direction. | A flexible hand (又) turns upside down beneath a cliff wall (厂) to reverse momentum and bounce back (反). | Una mano diestra (又) gira sobre sí misma bajo el acantilado (厂) invirtiendo el sentido para rebotar (反). | 214 | HE | 
  应 | yīng | respond; answer; ought to; should | responder; corresponder; deber | 广 | wide shelter | 广 (wide hall / echoing chamber) | 隹 (zhuī, bird / phonetic) | 7 | 半包围结构 | Simplified from 應. Ancient pictogram of a heart 心 answering an echo inside a wide chamber 广 beneath a perched bird 隹. | In a spacious echoing hall (广), voice calls out and returns an immediate harmonious answer (应). | En un salón abovedado y espacioso (广), la voz resuena devolviendo un eco fiel que responde a la llamada (应). | 51 | IF | 應

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: Turning back in reverse (反) to respond to a voice echoing in the hall (应) creates a dynamic physical or mental reaction (反应).
  composite_memory_hook_es: Invertir el curso (反) para corresponder al eco que resuena en la estancia (应) engendra una reacción viva (反应).
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: In ancient Daoist and medical philosophy, 反应 captures the fundamental cosmic principle of resonance (感应): every physical action or cosmic stimulus produces a reciprocal rebound in human consciousness or bodily organs.
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: Dipping 3rd tone followed by falling 4th tone: 'fǎn yìng' (214-51). Dip low on 'fǎn', then drop decisively on 'yìng'.

